<%# Shared decorative shell for the standalone authentication screens (Login,
    Sign Up, password reset, verification). Gives Login and Sign Up one
    coherent visual direction: a Tovitu-aligned background that supports the
    form without competing with it.

    The background is purely decorative — aria-hidden, non-interactive, and
    lightweight (flat CSS color fields + an inline SVG paw pattern, no raster
    assets). It is contained by overflow-hidden so it never adds horizontal
    scroll on small screens. %>
<div class="relative min-h-[calc(100vh-4rem)] overflow-hidden">
  <div class="auth-background absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none select-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="auth-background__block auth-background__block--secondary"></div>
    <div class="auth-background__paws"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-md mx-auto px-4 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <%= yield %>
  </div>
</div>